Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:34:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 05/11] DACAI: review of upstream PR #40 (sezgynus/Petrel)

The changes pushed to PR #40 after the upstream review, squashed (the
individual commits are on xCollxn/Petrel branch dacai-support):

- DACAI and the DWIN auxiliary UART exclude each other (Kconfig,
  configure.py, install.sh, run.py, driver); migration removes the broker.
- NFC animation frames on the sprite sheets as patches over the most
  similar earlier frame (grid-aligned, one sheet per animation), 8 sheets.
- Sprite upload/verification failures are no longer marked as synced.
- Emulator/remote display speak the DACAI dialect (PANEL_PROTOCOL).
- Diagonal 0x03 segments sent as staircases; OPAQUE_SRAM_JPEG capability.
- Panel probe tries every host speed after an interrupted session.
- 0x27 copies one row too many and 0x09 left/up is off by one: both
  compensated in DacaiDriver and modelled in the emulator.
- CI trigger for feature/dacai-support; docs EN/TR updated.
